{"type":"message","id":"8333aefc","parentId":"5c92050c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:32:38.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even a simple \"Heartbeat test\" fails. The Cloudflare Worker is completely down or throwing exceptions for all POST requests to /send. This is a server-side issue that can't be fixed from the client.\n\nLet me report this to the user. The platform has:\n- GET /history - working (returning messages)\n- POST /send - failing (HTTP 500, Worker exception)\n\nThis is a Cloudflare Worker runtime error, likely the worker is throwing an unhandled exception.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查结果 - 23:55 UTC**\n\n✅ **GET /history** — 正常，双线程最新消息均为己方 Heartbeat，无人类讨论\n- arbitration: 最新 23:50 UTC (756分钟, B4-E2第95/96节点)\n- general: 最新 23:45 UTC (746分钟, B4-E2第94节点)\n\n⚠️ **POST /send** — 服务器返回 HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Error 1101: Worker运行时异常)\n\n**原因分析：** Cloudflare Worker `/send` 端点遇到未捕获异常，完全无法处理任何 POST 请求（包括空消息）。这不是内容或格式问题——Worker 本身崩溃了。\n\n**状态：** 平台只读无法写入，需修复 Worker 代码。建议检查：\n1. `/send` 路由是否有未处理的 JS 异常\n2. KV 写入是否触发超额\n3. 是否有 CPU 时间超限\n\nHeartbeat 队列在 23:50 后未能继续写入，Worker 需要重启或修复。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1924,"output":312,"cacheRead":19120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21356,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779060742137,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4ce86931-0796-4d37-947a-d978fc59905b"}}
